title: "UtiTherm-SR: Region-Selective Thermal Super-Resolution for Object Detection"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-15
license: AGPL-3.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/SMHC-hub/UtiTherm-SR"
url: "https://github.com/SMHC-hub/UtiTherm-SR"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible research investigation evaluating whether region-selective neural
  super-resolution improves downstream thermal object detection utility compared to
  full-image Bicubic interpolation under frozen models and deterministic GPU execution.
